    "description": {
      "value": "<p>While you aren't wearing armor or wielding a Shield, you gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Dance Virtuoso.</strong> You have Advantage on any Charisma (Performance) check you make that involves dancing.</p><p><strong>Unarmored Defense.</strong> Your base Armor Class equals 10 plus your Dexterity and Charisma modifiers.</p><p><strong>Agile Strikes.</strong> When you expend a use of your Bardic Inspiration as part of an action, a Bonus Action, or a Reaction, you can make one Unarmed Strike as part of it.</p><p><strong>Bardic Damage.</strong> You can use Dexterity instead of Strength for the attack rolls of your Unarmed Strikes. When you deal damage with an Unarmed Strike, you can deal Bludgeoning damage equal to a roll of your Bardic Inspiration die plus your Dexterity modifier instead of the normal damage. This roll doesn't expend the die.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-DGZUnye3nBlcFCE0\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Unarmored Defense: set your armor calculation to a custom formula, 10 + @abilities.dex.mod + @abilities.cha.mod, while you wear no armor nor Shield.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
